    {
        "text": "What now? LUNG wRATh have hit a government-issued ambush blockade.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "In all the frenzy, Ernesto's decided to take up the rear, and the two heroines have caught his key and left to press forward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Ernesto's combat strength might be as impressive, but with this many enemies, his defeat could only be a matter of time anyway!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "But as for the heroines, they've broken out of the entrapment, but ambushes still lie ahead! Can they really get away without a hitch?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh? They've opened a door on the street and rushed inside!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "This store...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is one of Ernesto's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "So that's their game! Looks like the key Ernesto left them works for sheltering in a shop of his.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "But is this truly going to work out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on! Director, switch cameras!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright, that's the REAL game! From another angle it all makes sense. This store has a back door.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "And we can see, there's a passage from that door through to the main street, and it hasn't been discovered by any other team's interference!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Is this LUNG wRATh's chance, or is it\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
