    {
        "text": "The words are still on D.D.D.'s lips when, there on the screen, the sound of a tremendous explosion comes from Ernesto's arms store."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.3,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "musicvolume",
        "volume": 0.4,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wh\u2014Wh-Wh-What in the world is going on here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "Lady Candela, is that an obstacle you installed as well?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "If it was, it wouldn't be as basic as blowing up this one single shop.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_NPC_017_3"
    },
    {
        "text": "This... could it be that another team knew Ernesto had this up his sleeve, and laid a trap?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "If so, then we can say LUNG wRATh has been completely and utterly outdone!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "text": "LUNG wRATh, is this what buries you?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "D.D.D."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_190_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wow... Miss Ch'en and Miss Lin will be okay, won't they?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Eyjafjalla"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_190_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Relax, they've both been around the block. A little explosion like that's not gonna get them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_190_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_203_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "That said... this competition's no stranger to dirty play, but this one's a little too targeted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wonder if Ch'en's got beef with someone here.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
