    },
    {
        "text": "Grrr... what the hell's with this guy? I can't even hit him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ambush A"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "Uh... I think that's the way Miss Ch'en's bunch went.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_437_mizuki_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's go take a look and see.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mizuki"
    },
