        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "Hui-chieh, are you dead?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "fadetime": 0.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "*cough*, *cough*. Like that would kill me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$mist_intro",
        "key": "$mist_loop",
        "volume": 0.6,
        "crossfade": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You're alive. Good. Your bike?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Gone.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Yours?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Perfectly fine.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "It seems our opposition didn't want us dead and buried either.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "As luck would have it, the exit is blocked.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, good for luck.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Your view?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We find a way out. What else?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What I'm asking is who did it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Looks like our intuition was on the mark.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. Ernesto couldn't hold it in, I'm guessing.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "But don't you think it's odd? If I were him, this isn't how I'd do it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Only one at the end of his rope would use such self-destructive means.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe, it wasn't actually him.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Impossible.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Maybe, he wants us to think he's desperate.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "......",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lin Y\u00fchsia raises her eyebrows, and leaves it be."
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Right. Have you told Lady Candela about the matter?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How did she respond?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
