        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You won't do anything... will you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right, my girl. You're a smart one. You should be able to figure it out.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I sent someone to inspect the bombs now, wouldn't that just be telling the mastermind I've noticed their schemes?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I understand.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter, Ch'en. You and Lin have done very well already.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "To be frank, at the start I had no expectations you'd find anything at all, hahaha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And you don't seem to care?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course, my girl.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "And you needn't worry about this too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "text": "I've seen you and Lin put on a very good show in the championship. Why not forget all this, and try your very hardest for number one? You'll put a smile on Wei Yenwu's face too, hahaha.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Candela"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_198_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll take it into consideration.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
