        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You can probably imagine it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Easily.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Now, how do we get out?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I heard a certain Special Inspection Unit Chief could dice apart a whole building in her rage. Mind showing me first-hand?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Not every building's so sliceable. This one's clearly built from exceptionally sturdy stuff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you use your sand ability to transport things?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not my dad. A blockage of this level, with my ability, would need some time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Then I'll have a go.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#2",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No need. I have another method.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "What is it?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Can you guess what this is?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...A bomb?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Do you remember the bomb from the first round?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "There was no way Lady Candela could conduct a wide search, but I had a few of the boys here dress up as thieves and enter the neighborhood to steal as many as they could.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#4",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Thieves?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Thieves. So long as they gave the guards a bribe, and didn't make too much noise inside, no one would care about them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#7",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "........",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "Lin Y\u00fchsia.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "What.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You might be unalike, but I have always deeply respected you and Mr. Lin.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "text": "The slums couldn't go on without you, I know that much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't let me catch you enjoying yourself.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_1013_spchen_1#7",
        "name2": "avg_npc_196_1#5",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Hui-chieh... nobody would ever assign themselves blame of their own accord.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
    {
        "text": "Out of the way. I'm going to set the bomb.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lin Y\u00fchsia"
    },
